BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tabling at Bloomington Pridefest with ACLU of Indiana
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T140000
UID:5d030da6738c0cbc27cf4527e2bcfd94@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PRIDE%20-%20Bloomington_20260804195146322155.png
DESCRIPTION:The ACLU-IN will be at a pride event near you this summer\, an
 d we want to meet you! Help us run a booth at the upcoming Pridefest in Bl
 oomington\, on August 22. Volunteering to table a booth with ACLU means th
 at you will get the chance to work closely with ACLU-IN staff members and 
 talk to Hoosiers about civil liberties. Before the scheduled event you wil
 l receive more information and training about what to expect\, guidance ab
 out how to connect with folks\, and specific arrival/parking instruction
LOCATION:Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/1003604/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
