BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garfield Park Concert - Pride of Indy Bands
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T180000
UID:17520dad31ece40a570751218c1b508e@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20133707_20260801173725282822.png
DESCRIPTION:Join Indivisible Central Indiana for an evening of live music 
 with the Pride of Indy Band at Garfield Park! This is a free public concer
 t event to support local arts. We will meet up before the event around 6:0
 0 to chat and get everyone together\, then we will head to the concert are
 a. More information will be provided as we get closer to the event date. (
 Note: Indivisible Central Indiana is not sponsoring the vent or partnering
  with Pride of Indy on the event\; we are merely attending.) Please RS
LOCATION:MacAllister Amphitheater\, 2425 Conservatory Dr\, Indianapolis\, 
 IN\, 46203
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/998856/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Indivisible Northeast Indiana August Members' Meetup
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T173000
UID:b35136b2cbf2e92571537414d98a235a@mobilize.us
