 ploads/event/Virtual%20Phone%20Bank%20ACLU_20260807204555359649.png
DESCRIPTION:Phone banking and text banking with the ACLU empowers voluntee
 rs to contact voters to mobilize support for key civil rights and educate 
 citizens about their voting rights. While virtual phone banking is live\, 
 the advocacy team of ACLU of Indiana will host 30-minute Zoom orientations
  most Tuesdays and Thursdays. These training and helpline sessions will or
 ient new volunteers and address any questions that arise for volunteers al
 ready trained and engaged in phone banking. ACLU of Indiana phone ban
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/981206/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
